# Keep the Docker build context lean — only the web project is built.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.pdb
**/node_modules/
.git/
.github/
.claude/

# WPF desktop apps aren't built in this container.
UrbanBoutiqueAdmin/
UrbanBoutiqueCashier/
BoutiqueUrbanPOS/

# Docs / binaries
*.pdf
*.md
!UrbanBoutiqueWeb/**/*.md

# Local dev overrides
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
